.DS_Store
.claude/
**/.claude/taste-signals.jsonl
**/.claude/taste-watch/

# The user's global excludes (~/.config/git/ignore) drop SUMMARY.md and HANDOFF.md,
# which are required deliverables here — a hub whose own source map is untracked is
# not a source of truth. Re-include them explicitly; a negation in a repo .gitignore
# overrides the global file.
!SUMMARY.md
!HANDOFF.md
!**/SUMMARY.md
!**/HANDOFF.md
